          %p
            A discussion of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/path+space+objects"} path space objects
            of and hence of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/right+homotopies"} right homotopies
            between
            = succeed "-algebras" do
